CodeMirror 6, used by static/js/wkcm.js as the editor of knowledge pages (2.554.0, #4052).

Packages: CodeMirror 6 (MIT, see LICENSE), bundled with esbuild into ONE file that sets the global "CM6".
          The exact versions and their npm "integrity" (sha512, checked by npm ci on download) are in
          tools/codemirror/package-lock.json; the parts the editor uses are listed in tools/codemirror/entry.js.
          @codemirror/commands        6.11.1
          @codemirror/language        6.13.1
          @codemirror/search          6.7.2
          @codemirror/state           6.7.6
          @codemirror/streamparser    6.0.0
          @codemirror/view            6.43.15
          @lezer/common               1.5.5
          @lezer/highlight            1.2.5
          @lezer/lr                   1.4.12
          @lezer/markdown             1.8.1
          @marijn/find-cluster-break  1.0.4
          crelt                       1.0.7
          style-mod                   4.1.4
          w3c-keyname                 2.2.8
          Markdown is parsed by @lezer/markdown with its GitHub extensions; @codemirror/lang-markdown is left out on
          purpose (it brings HTML, CSS and JavaScript parsers the editor does not need).
Built:    tools/build_codemirror.sh (npm ci --ignore-scripts in a temporary folder, esbuild 0.28.2 --minify, IIFE).
          The same input gives the same file byte for byte.
Files:    codemirror.min.js (the bundle), LICENSE (the license text of every bundled package).
Loaded:   only by the knowledge module when a page is edited (wkcm.js wkcm_load); not in the service worker's
          precache, like KaTeX and Mermaid. Never from a CDN (strict CSP).
Update:   change the versions in tools/codemirror/package.json, renew the lock file (npm install --ignore-scripts in
          tools/codemirror, then delete node_modules there), run tools/build_codemirror.sh, update this README and
          THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
          sha256 db11c321c230174c718e3a0ab9b812429f61ce7c411ef88d66053cf862dba4cd  codemirror.min.js
